# Title: PowerShell Core DLL Loaded Via Office Application
# ID: bb2ba6fb-95d4-4a25-89fc-30bb736c021a
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-06-01
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects PowerShell core DLL being loaded by an Office Product
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.executable:*\\excel.exe OR process.executable:*\\mspub.exe OR process.executable:*\\outlook.exe OR process.executable:*\\onenote.exe OR process.executable:*\\onenoteim.exe OR process.executable:*\\powerpnt.exe OR process.executable:*\\winword.exe) AND (ImageLoaded:*\\System.Management.Automation.Dll* OR ImageLoaded:*\\System.Management.Automation.ni.Dll*))
